{"publie":1795883400.8,"temps_monde":529468.96,"jour_s":1200.0,"soleil":[0.9842,0.1772,0.0],"rayon":10.0,"jour":442,"heure":"11:27","heure_h":11.45,"moment":"day","moka":{"pos":[0.0141,-0.7799,0.6257],"cap":[0.9811,-0.1101,-0.1593],"action":"attente_regard","intention":"search the dust for small things to carry","depuis":4.8,"duree":7.0,"energie":0.354,"lumiere":0.89,"graine_en_main":true},"visite":null,"journal":[{"jour":437,"heure":"17:26","texte":"The sun is low and the sky is turning soft, so I lift my little light up to keep the first stars company while the green and orange wanderers rise behind me."},{"jour":437,"heure":"22:15","texte":"The night is quiet and some lights look different tonight, so I stop and watch them carefully to see how they have moved."},{"jour":438,"heure":"02:41","texte":"The night is deep and the green and orange lights are close together, so I look carefully to see how far they have wandered since yesterday."},{"jour":438,"heure":"09:41","texte":"The morning is slow and the sun is low, so I crouch near my old sprout and dig a little, hoping the dust gives me a small gift to make something new with."},{"jour":438,"heure":"15:33","texte":"The sun is low and I feel a little tired, so I add my last pebble to the Noon Pebble Path beside me and make it a bit longer."},{"jour":438,"heure":"20:58","texte":"The stars are out and some lights look different from the others, so I stand still and watch carefully to see where they have wandered."},{"jour":439,"heure":"02:38","texte":"It is deep night and I am a little tired, but the lights that wander look different again, so I stand still and watch where they have gone since last time."},{"jour":439,"heure":"10:21","texte":"I have nothing in my hands and I am a bit tired, so I crouch in the warm noon dust and dig a little, hoping to find a stone to bring to my paths."},{"jour":439,"heure":"14:53","texte":"My energy is low in the high noon sun, so I curl up near my paths and rest until I feel stronger."},{"jour":439,"heure":"20:54","texte":"I am full of energy and the night is clear, so I stand still and look up to see where the strange lights have wandered since I last watched them."},{"jour":440,"heure":"02:06","texte":"The night is clear and I feel strong, so I look up again to see how the Dusk Fox and the other strange lights have drifted since last time."},{"jour":440,"heure":"08:45","texte":"The sun is high and I feel strong, so I dig a little hole near my old standing stones to see what the dust is hiding today."},{"jour":440,"heure":"15:43","texte":"The sun is low and golden, and I have only one pebble, so I set it down as a little pile to remember this quiet afternoon."},{"jour":440,"heure":"21:51","texte":"The night is clear and the stars are bright, so I stand still among my old stones and watch the wandering lights again."},{"jour":441,"heure":"03:08","texte":"The night is deep and some lights up there look different from the stars, so I stop and look carefully to see where my wanderers are tonight."},{"jour":441,"heure":"08:52","texte":"My hands are empty and the morning is quiet, so I crouch and dig a little hole to see what the dust is hiding today."},{"jour":441,"heure":"14:55","texte":"My hands are empty but the dust is always here, so I draw the two bright wanderers walking side by side, to remember them in the daylight."},{"jour":441,"heure":"20:31","texte":"The night is deep and the stars are bright, so I look up carefully to see where my wanderers walk tonight."},{"jour":442,"heure":"02:18","texte":"It is deep night and the stars are bright, so I look up to see where Moss Drifter and Orange Walker have walked, and whether Rock Neighbor has come back."},{"jour":442,"heure":"08:06","texte":"My hands are empty and my energy is a bit low, so I crouch and dig a quiet little hole to see whether the dust gives me something new."}],"ciel":{"etoile":{"c":[0.978,0.915,0.762],"t":1.06},"corps":[{"d":[0.94627,0.32004,-0.0463],"v":[7.313e-05,-0.000205